---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Self-Hypnosis Workshop in Kathmandu (One Day)" 
  description="A one-day intensive self-hypnosis workshop in Kathmandu. Learn to guide yourself into deep relaxation to manage stress, build confidence and work on your goals."
>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F5F1EA] to-white pt-16 pb-12 border-b border-[#e2e8f0]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] leading-tight">Self Help with Self-Hypnosis: One-Day Workshop</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
        Self-hypnosis is a skill: guiding yourself into a state of deep relaxation and focused attention, then using it to work on a chosen goal. In this one-day intensive workshop, you learn how to do it safely and practise it with guidance.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="py-12 bg-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-10 text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-4">What you will learn</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>What hypnosis is and is not, with common myths cleared up</li>
          <li>How to enter and leave a relaxed, focused state safely</li>
          <li>How to use self-hypnosis to manage stress, build confidence, and support focus</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>